@host = http://localhost:5080
@aliceIncidentId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Health/readiness
GET {{host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Working list flow
GET {{host}}/api/incidents
Accept: application/json

### Filtered list
GET {{host}}/api/incidents?status=Triaged
Accept: application/json

### Existing details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceIncidentId}}
Accept: application/json

### Missing resource: expected 404 Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999
Accept: application/json

### Invalid filter: expected 400 Validation Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents?status=Unknown
Accept: application/json

### Lab 1 extension point: expected 501 before student implementation
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary
Accept: application/json

### T-06: Успішна відповідь без фільтра (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:5080/api/incidents/severity-summary
Accept: application/json

### T-06a: Фільтр Triaged (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:5080/api/incidents/severity-summary?status=Triaged
Accept: application/json

### T-06b: Фільтр Resolved (200 OK, порожній масив)
GET http://localhost:5080/api/incidents/severity-summary?status=Resolved
Accept: application/json

### T-06c: Невалідний статус (400 Bad Request)
GET http://localhost:5080/api/incidents/severity-summary?status=Unknown
Accept: application/json
